3252						;
3253						; Read byte from EEPROM by 0-based CMOS RAM offset (readCMOSByte) or
3254						; RTC register index (readRTCByte).
3255						;
3256						; (The number of RTC registers on the Compact is 0, so readRTCByte and
3257						; readCMOSByte use the same indexes. Nevertheless, the two routines
3258						; behave differently... presumably I still haven't quite got this bit
3259						; right.)
3260						;
